                <pb facs="0791" n="697" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg697"/>

                <head>No. 441.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Manning to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-03-21"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 21,
                        1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bayard</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Your dispatch reached me at Puebla; correction made to-day.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Manning.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
